OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 14, charged over Bromley
OL,4,Astabbing investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 14-year-old boy has been charged as
OL,7,Fpart of a police investigation into a
OL,8,Fstabbing in Bromley that left three
OL,9,Fteenagers and a man injured.
OL,11,FOfficers were called to Bromley High
OL,12,FStreet at about 14:15 BST on 10
OL,13,FSeptember after reports of a fight,
OL,14,Fwhere three boys aged 14 to 17 and a
OL,15,F21-year-old man were found with stab
OL,16,Fwounds.
OL,18,FAll four were taken to hospital. The
OL,19,FMet said three boys have since been
OL,20,Fdischarged, while the 21-year-old
OL,21,Fremains in hospital with injuries not
OL,22,Fbelieved to be life-threatening.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
